            </note>
            <note corresp="#d536-f3" n="7" xml:id="d536-f3-content">
                <p>Treaty of Peace between the Allied and Associated Powers and Bulgaria signed at
                    Neuilly-sur-Seine on November 27, 1919; for text, see <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >British and Foreign State Papers</hi>, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >cxii</hi>, p. 781.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
